{title: Lambi Judai}
{artist: Kamran Ahmed Jannat}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Char dino ka [G]pyaar o rabba,        [F]Lambi judai [G]lambi judai
[Am]Char dino ka [G]pyaar o rabba,        [F]Lambi judai [G]lambi judai
[Am]Tere bin dil mera [G]lage kahin na,        [Am]Tere bin jaan meri [G]jaye kahin na
[Am]Kitne zamane [G]baad o rabba,        [F]Yaad tu aaya, [G]yaad tu aaya
[Am]Khoya raha mein, [G]saason mein apne,        [F]Aahat bhi teri, [G]bhool gaya mein
[Am]Kitna jeeya hoon [G]tanha raho hoon,        [F]Ishq tera [G]bhool gaya hoon
[Am]Khoya raha mein, [G]saason mein apne,        [F]Aahat bhi teri, [G]bhool gaya mein
[Am]Kitna jeeya hoon [G]tanha raho hoon,        [F]Ishq tera [G]bhool gaya hoon
[Am]Uljha raha mein [G]is zindagi mein,        [F]Dil ki duhai [G]dil ki duhai
[Am]Tere bin dil mera [G]lage kahin na,        [Am]Tere bin jaan meri [G]jaye kahin na
[Am]Kitne zamane [G]baad o rabba,        [F]Yaad tu aaya, [G]yaad tu aaya
[Am]Har bebasi mein, [G]is zindagi ne,        [F]Tujh ko hi chaha, [G]tujh ko hi manga
[Am]Jin raston se [G]guzra yeh dil tha,        [F]Manzil mili na [G]pyaar na paya
[Am]Har bebasi mein, [G]is zindagi ne,        [F]Tujh ko hi chaha, [G]tujh ko hi manga
[Am]Jin raston se [G]guzra yeh dil tha,        [F]Manzil mili na [G]pyaar na paya
[Am]Khud ko chupake [G]rahon se guzre,        [F]Dil ko sambhle [G]dil ko sambhle
[Am]Tere bin dil mera [G]lage kahin na,        [Am]Tere bin jaan meri [G]jaye kahin na
